            "line": 227,
            "text": "theorem cylinderChange_graph {Q Qr : ℝ} (hQ : 0 < Q) (hQr : 0 < Qr)\n    (h : ℝ) (i gap : ℕ) {z : SpaceTime} (hz : 0 < z.2 0) :\n    cylinderChange h Q Qr gap ((PhysicalResidualBridge.commonGraph Q h i).map z) =\n      (PhysicalResidualBridge.commonGraph Qr h (i + gap)).map z"
